{
    "title": "Pickleheads - Play Pickleball",
    "description": "Dive into the world of pickleball with Pickleheads, the easiest way to find and organize games!\r\n\r\nNEW: Now the Official Court & Game Finder of USA Pickleball!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccd Find Places to Play: With over 16,000 locations in the US, Canada, and worldwide, you're never far from a court. Pickleheads has the most extensive and accurate directory of places to play pickleball. Our community-driven directory makes it easy to find a nearby court.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc4b Discover Nearby Games: Easily find games tailored to your skill level. We bring together play schedules from every city, so you're always in the loop.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc65 Join Groups: Become a part of local pickleball groups, chat with other players, and get invited to play.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Organize a Game: Pull together a game or a round robin in seconds. Invite players, manage sign-ups, handle waitlists, collect payments and more. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca Find other players at your level: Add your skill level rating to your profile and recruit nearby players. We support DUPR, UTR-P and other major rating systems.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcda Learn & Improve: Whether you're just starting out or looking to refine your skills, we constantly post guides to improve your game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Dive into the world of pickleball with Pickleheads, the easiest way to find and organize games!<br><br>NEW: Now the Official Court &amp; Game Finder of USA Pickleball!<br><br>\ud83d\udccd Find Places to Play: With over 16,000 locations in the US, Canada, and worldwide, you&#39;re never far from a court. Pickleheads has the most extensive and accurate directory of places to play pickleball. Our community-driven directory makes it easy to find a nearby court.<br><br>\ud83d\udc4b Discover Nearby Games: Easily find games tailored to your skill level. We bring together play schedules from every city, so you&#39;re always in the loop.<br><br>\ud83d\udc65 Join Groups: Become a part of local pickleball groups, chat with other players, and get invited to play.<br><br>\ud83d\udcc5 Organize a Game: Pull together a game or a round robin in seconds. Invite players, manage sign-ups, handle waitlists, collect payments and more. <br><br>\ud83d\udcca Find other players at your level: Add your skill level rating to your profile and recruit nearby players. We support DUPR, UTR-P and other major rating systems.<br><br>\ud83d\udcda Learn &amp; Improve: Whether you&#39;re just starting out or looking to refine your skills, we constantly post guides to improve your game.",
